SELECT fasttrun_analyze('t44_b');
WARNING:  fasttrun: column statistics cache exceeds fasttrun.max_stats_memory, new tables are left without column statistics
DETAIL:  A table without cached column statistics behaves as with fasttrun.auto_collect_stats = off: relation-level statistics keep working, the planner falls back to default selectivity. Tables that already hold cached column statistics keep refreshing; nothing is evicted.
HINT:  Raise fasttrun.max_stats_memory, or recycle the connection to free the cache. fasttrun_cache_stats() reports the current cache size.
